TITLE: ATIS and initial-call cases
STATEMENT: >>>
The pattern mission test shall show an ATIS request in the phrase log and a pattern-entry call that includes the information letter returned by the scripted peer. Acceptance is a completed mission whose first phrase parses as ATIS. The test file is apps/aircraft/tests/test_mission.py.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The scripted peer is the stand-in for the tower.
<<<
DAL: E
